<title>USA: PSE to list PhyMatrix options on Jan 6.</title>
<headline>PSE to list PhyMatrix options on Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange said Tuesday it would list options on PhyMatrix Corp on January 6.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will open with strike prices of 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2 and will have initial expirations in January, February, May and August.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to market maker Sheldon Kahn of Pax West.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
